Package: gis2shiny
Title: Turn GIS Vector Data into Interactive Shiny Applications
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person('David', 'Amakye', role = c('aut', 'cre'), email = 'amakyekojodavid@gmail.com')
Description: Creates interactive Shiny applications from simple features objects
    and vector GIS files, with maps, attribute filters, tables, summaries,
    and downloads.
URL: https://github.com/david-amakye/gis2shiny
BugReports: https://github.com/david-amakye/gis2shiny/issues
